;Aida::Ss:<Kom.6C3.Src>Quit.Mac.2,  7-Aug-87 17:06:37, Ed: Zot
;61?	Use GTKOM% rather than GTJFN% if FTJSY2 set 
;Oden::DSKG:QUIT.MAC<62,7777,MAC> 1987-03-12 16:55:11, Edit by KPJ @ L89 <1,2>
