;Tor::Ps:<KPJ.KOM>QUIT.MAC.9 30-Sep-86 16:07:50, Edit by KPJ
;46	Eliminated bug introduced in edit#44.
;Tor::Ps:<KPJ.KOM>QUIT.MAC.6 30-Sep-86 13:42:53, Edit by KPJ
;45	If memory save fails, don't tell user. Since we are using buffered I/O,
;	the message will appear out of phase anyway.
;Tor::Ps:<KPJ.KOM>QUIT.MAC.4 29-Sep-86 18:17:29, Edit by KPJ
;44	DMPWWI created incorrect page map, using bogus byte pointer.
;Tor::Ps:<KPJ.KOM>QUIT.MAC.3 29-Sep-86 17:34:33, Edit by KPJ
